    <p class="mrgn-bttm-0">The data used to create this interactive web application is from the following listed data tables: </p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="/t1/tbl1/en/tv.action?pid=1410028701">Table 14-10-0287-01 Labour force characteristics, monthly, seasonally adjusted and trend-cycle, last 5 months</a></li>
